  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/459fad44-da37-49a6-99e9-83085f49c48d\" alt=\"cflogobanner\"></p>\n<h3><strong>关于：</strong></h3>\n<p>Create: Food 是一款旨在扩展 Minecraft 食物内容的模组附加包。</p>\n<p>以下模组非强制安装，但为核心依赖。缺少它们将导致许多物品无法合成。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>以下模组非必需，但强烈建议安装。缺少它们会导致内容出现明显缺失。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/delightful-creators-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Delightful Creators</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/display-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Display Delight</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>关于与 Create 和 Farmer's Delight 附加包的兼容信息，请查看<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food-multiloader/wiki/Compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</p>\n<h3><strong>当前内容：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>包含超过 1000 种食物相关物品和 100 多种新流体。查看物品列表请见<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food-multiloader/wiki/Item-list\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</li>\n<li>所有内容均高度可配置，包括隐藏物品、修改营养/饱和度数值，以及添加自定义物品、方块、流体和展示盘。了解更多请见<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food-multiloader/wiki/Config-Options\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</li>\n<li>完整实现了来自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flets-do.ch%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's Do 系列</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kaleidoscope-cookery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kaleidoscope Cookery</a> 等模组的效果。</li>\n<li>为简单配方提供手工合成系统。了解更多请见<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food-multiloader/wiki/Handcrafting-Guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</li>\n<li>任何物品均可放置在展示盘上。你也可以直接从盘中食用，或将其用作砧板。阅读指南请见<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food-multiloader/wiki/Display-Blocks-Guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</li>\n<li>布制过滤器，支持手持使用或加入配方。了解更多请见<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food-multiloader/wiki/Cloth-Filters-Guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</li>\n<li>两种存储方块：布袋和口粮箱。了解更多请见<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food-multiloader/wiki/Storage-Blocks-Guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</li>\n<li>可放置的披萨、蛋糕、派（包括南瓜派）等方块。</li>\n<li>热饮的动态纹理。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>2.0.0 版本之前的更新信息可查看<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</p>\n<h3><strong>物品预览 (2.5.0)</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a20d646f-981a-4eaa-8755-852639e6cd96\" alt=\"fullprev250\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/993237fc-c7c8-4325-a47b-9e9401f5b213\" alt=\"bucketprev240\"></p>\n<h3><strong>我的其他模组</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-engineers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Engineers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-metalwork-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Metalwork</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/delightful-chefs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Delightful Chefs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rune-essence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rune Essence</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stack-size-edit-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stack Size Edit</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>致谢：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>纹理素材基于 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a> 中的资源制作。</li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
